ight--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was hinted in Mortal Remains, I think- and even if Cheiron were to buy them, they could still operate, just not as independent as before. Again, as it was only hinted, you could easily ignore that detail.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, but they cant get the Deva Corporation? Whatevs, I cant even remember if LDI was mentioned in the Mummy 2nd edition manuscripts","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T22:41:31-07:00","id":1374711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1374581-the-flame-marches-on-musing-about-the-future-of-hunter-s-orgs?p=1374681#post1374681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, but they cant get the Deva Corporation?</div> </div> </div> </div>Deva has deep pockets and the attention of the Machine. Also, LDI isn't mentioned in Mortal Remains at all and it's rather difficult to point to Cheiron's alluded-to new acquisitions as Last Dynasty in particular when one of the types of cult in Mummy is &quot;this has a legitimate business working as a front for it&quot; and the incident alluded to in the same writeup seems pretty clear in being &quot;one of tho